{
  "id": "chat",
  "name": "Chat",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "frontend_tools": [
    {
      "name": "render_ui",
      "description": "Show rich, optionally interactive content to the user: cards, tables, images, a carousel, stats, tabs, steppers, choices, inputs, buttons. Input: {\"root\": node, \"placement\"?, \"id\"?, \"title\"?}. A node is {\"type\", \"props\", \"children\"?, \"on\"?, \"visible\"?}; only Stack, Card, Tabs and Stepper take children.\nPlacement: inline in the chat (default) or a live area: top, bottom, or a tab on the right (needs an id and a title). A call with the same id replaces that item; {\"id\", \"remove\": true} removes it.\nSession State: any prop can be {\"$state\": \"/path\"}, {\"$template\": \"Score: ${/quiz/score}\"} or {\"$computed\": \"count\", \"args\": {\"values\": {\"$state\": \"/quiz/results\"}, \"eq\": true}} (also \"length\" and \"sum\") and updates when the state changes (change it with state_patch). Choice and Input write the user's answer with {\"$bindState\": \"/path\"}. on.press/change/submit run actions: {\"action\": \"setState\"|\"pushState\", \"params\": {\"statePath\", \"value\"}}, {\"action\": \"removeState\", \"params\": {\"statePath\", \"index\"?}}, {\"action\": \"sendMessage\", \"params\": {\"text\"}} (sends the text to you as the user's next message; text can be a $template). \"visible\" shows a node only when the state says so, e.g. {\"$state\": \"/quiz/answers/q1\"} (answered) or {\"$state\": \"/quiz/step\", \"eq\": 2}. The user's state changes do not reach you by themselves: add a sendMessage when you must react.\nFor a test or quiz: one right tab (or inline card) with a Stepper of questions (its Next button moves on); each Choice with `answer`, `result` and `explanation` grades itself and explains, and a Stat with $computed count shows the score.\nUse it for results, status, comparisons, screenshots or interactive tasks, instead of a long plain message. Components:\n- Stack(direction?: vertical|horizontal, gap?: sm|md|lg) + children: Lays out children vertically (default) or in a row; children in a row share the width.\n- Card(title?, tone?: neutral|info|success|warning|error) + children: A bordered box with an optional title and tone; holds children.\n- Markdown(text): Markdown text.\n- KeyValue(items): Label/value rows.\n- Table(columns, rows): A table: column headings and rows of cell text.\n- Badge(text, tone?: neutral|info|success|warning|error): A short label, e.g. a status.\n- Code(code, language?): A code block.\n- Image(src, alt, caption?): One image; the user can open it full size.\n- Carousel(images): Several images, one at a time, with previous/next.\n- Stat(label, value, hint?, tone?: neutral|info|success|warning|error): One number or short value with a label, e.g. a score.\n- Progress(value, max?, label?): A progress bar from 0 to max (default 100).\n- Choice(options, value: $bindState, answer?, result?: $bindState, explanation?, columns?: 1|2): Options to pick one from (distinct values); writes the picked value to `value` ($bindState). For a quiz, set `answer` to the correct value: after a pick it shows right/wrong, locks, writes true/false to `result` ($bindState) and shows `explanation`. `on.change` runs after a pick. on: change.\n- Input(value: $bindState, label?, placeholder?): A text field; writes its text to its $bindState path. `on.submit` runs on Enter. on: submit.\n- Button(label, variant?: primary|secondary|ghost, disabled?): A button; `on.press` runs its actions. on: press.\n- Tabs(tabs, value?: $bindState) + children: Tabs: one child per tab, one shown at a time. `value` ($bindState, optional) holds the open tab's index.\n- Stepper(steps, value?: $bindState) + children: Steps shown one at a time with Back/Next, e.g. the questions of a test: one child per step. `value` ($bindState, optional) holds the step index. `on.finish` runs when the user presses Finish on the last step. on: finish.",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Names this item: a later call with the same id replaces it. Required for top, bottom and right."
          },
          "placement": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "inline",
              "top",
              "bottom",
              "right"
            ],
            "description": "Where it shows: inline in the chat (default), or in a live area of the chat: top, bottom, or a tab on the right."
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Label of the right-side tab."
          },
          "remove": {
            "const": true,
            "description": "Remove the item with this id."
          },
          "root": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/node"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "remove": {
                  "const": true
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "remove"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "id"
              ]
            },
            "else": {
              "required": [
                "root"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "placement": {
                  "enum": [
                    "top",
                    "bottom",
                    "right"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "placement"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "id"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "$defs": {
          "expr": {
            "description": "Read from the Session State: {\"$state\": \"/path\"}, {\"$template\": \"Score: ${/quiz/score}\"}, or {\"$computed\": \"count\"|\"length\"|\"sum\", \"args\": {\"values\", \"eq\"?}}.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "$state": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "$state"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "$template": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "$template"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "$computed": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "count",
                      "length",
                      "sum"
                    ]
                  },
                  "args": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "values": {},
                      "eq": {}
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "values"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "$computed",
                  "args"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            ]
          },
          "visible": {
            "description": "Show the node only when true: {\"$state\": \"/path\"} (truthy), with \"eq\", \"neq\" or \"not\": true; {\"$and\": [...]}, {\"$or\": [...]}; or a boolean.",
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "$state": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "eq": {},
                  "neq": {},
                  "not": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "$state"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "$and": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/visible"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "$and"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "$or": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/visible"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "$or"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            ]
          },
          "bind": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "$bindState": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "$bindState"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "description": "Two-way binding: {\"$bindState\": \"/path\"}."
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "action": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "setState",
                  "pushState",
                  "removeState",
                  "sendMessage"
                ]
              },
              "params": {
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "action",
              "params"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "allOf": [
              {
                "if": {
                  "properties": {
                    "action": {
                      "enum": [
                        "setState",
                        "pushState"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "then": {
                  "properties": {
                    "params": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "statePath": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "value": {}
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "statePath",
                        "value"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "if": {
                  "properties": {
                    "action": {
                      "const": "removeState"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "then": {
                  "properties": {
                    "params": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "statePath": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "index": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "statePath"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "if": {
                  "properties": {
                    "action": {
                      "const": "sendMessage"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "then": {
                  "properties": {
                    "params": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "text": {
                          "anyOf": [
                            {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "#/$defs/expr"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "text"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "node": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "Stack",
                  "Card",
                  "Markdown",
                  "KeyValue",
                  "Table",
                  "Badge",
                  "Code",
                  "Image",
                  "Carousel",
                  "Stat",
                  "Progress",
                  "Choice",
                  "Input",
                  "Button",
                  "Tabs",
                  "Stepper"
                ]
              },
              "props": {
                "type": "object"
              },
              "children": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/node"
                },
                "description": "Only for Stack, Card, Tabs and Stepper."
              },
              "on": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "press": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "#/$defs/action"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "$ref": "#/$defs/action"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "change": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "#/$defs/action"
                      },
                      {
